(SPLENDOR - Demo Rulebook \(Board Game Cafe\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(Players are gem merchants. They collect gem tokens to buy development cards that give) Tj T*
(permanent gem bonuses and prestige points, and they attract nobles.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SETUP) Tj T*
(Use all 7 tokens of each gem with 4 players, 5 with 3 players and 4 with 2 players.) Tj T*
(Always use the 5 gold tokens. Reveal 4 cards of each of the 3 levels and one more) Tj T*
(noble than players.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(YOUR TURN) Tj T*
(Do exactly one action:) Tj T*
(- Take 3 gem tokens of different colors.) Tj T*
(- Take 2 gem tokens of the same color. This is allowed only if that pile has at least) Tj T*
(   4 tokens.) Tj T*
(- Reserve a development card \(face up or the top card of a deck\) and take 1 gold token) Tj T*
(   \(joker\).) Tj T*
(You may never have more than 3 reserved cards.) Tj T*
(- Buy a face-up development card or one of your reserved cards.) Tj T*
ET
