(BUYING CARDS) Tj T*
(Pay the cost with tokens. Each card you own gives a permanent bonus of its color and) Tj T*
(reduces the cost of future cards by 1 gem of that color. Gold tokens replace any) Tj T*
(color. A card with enough bonuses can be bought for free. Replace a bought face-up) Tj T*
(card from the same level.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(TOKEN LIMIT) Tj T*
(At the end of your turn you may hold at most 10 tokens \(gold included\). Return extras) Tj T*
(of your choice.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(NOBLES) Tj T*
(At the end of your turn, if your card bonuses meet a noble's requirement, that noble) Tj T*
(visits you automatically. Each noble is worth 3 prestige points. Only one noble can) Tj T*
(visit per turn.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(END OF THE GAME) Tj T*
(When a player reaches 15 prestige points, finish the current round so everyone had the) Tj T*
(same number of turns. The player with the most prestige points wins. On a tie, the) Tj T*
(player with fewer development cards wins.) Tj T*
ET
